    <h2>Thank you for being part of this chapter.</h2>
    <p>Eighty years is an extraordinary achievement — but it is only possible because of the thousands of cadets, officers, volunteers, and families who have given their time, dedication, and passion to this squadron since 1946. That spirit continues today in every cadet who wears the 395 badge. We look forward to seeing you again at the next one.</p>
